@title Lesson card and heat legend: the legend keeps clear of the card, both in view
@area Cabinet
# At 1366x768 the card sits in the bottom right; the Temperature legend hangs from the top right and must stay above it.
click_text "Learn…"
wait 15
text cabinet layout
wait 8
click_text Start #1
wait 40
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 40
key shift+h
wait 60
shot heat-with-card
check_blank heat-with-card
check_layout
